# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# JobFill .gitignore
#
# The most important entries here are the "local data" ones. This project
# stores real personal information (name, address, phone, work history). None
# of it may ever reach a remote. Anything matching *.local.json is treated as
# private user data and is never committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Personal profile data. seed.local.json is an optional file a user can create
# to bulk-import their details through the options page without typing them in.
*.local.json
seed.local.json
profile-export*.json

# Resumes / cover letters / transcripts that might get dropped in the repo root
# while testing the document upload flow.
*.pdf
*.docx
!docs/**/*.pdf

# Dev dependencies (Vitest + jsdom). Users never need these to run the
# extension, so nothing here belongs in git.
node_modules/
coverage/

# Packaged builds produced by `npm run zip` for manual distribution.
dist/
*.zip

# Editor / OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
